{"id":8837478,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/8315","number":8315,"state":"closed","title":"fix(fa-mla): multiCoreInnerIdx在skip的gS1块时不应递增","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8315","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8315/issues","body":"## 描述\nFA MLA noquant场景下，当batch的s2LoopEndIdx<=0被skip时，multiCoreInnerIdx仍会递增，导致softmaxSumBuf/softmaxMaxBuf的mod3槽位索引与实际写入次数错位，PRELOAD_N=1场景下vec1覆写vec2未读的softmax状态，attention_out计算错误。\n\n## 改动\n- 将multiCoreInnerIdx  从ComputeAxisIdxByBnAndGs1（skip检查之前）移到Process()的skip检查之后\n- 确保只在真正执行task时递增，保证槽位索引与实际写入次数一一对应\n- 不影响原有非skip场景的行为\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#3611\n\n## 测试\n- 多batch场景（含空batch）attention_out结果正确，与PRELOAD_N=0一致\n- 无skip场景行为不受影响\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复","assignees_number":2,"assignees":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false}],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pen